Card decks
----------

Are not included. But the configure process tries to determine, where
either the KDE carddecks (from the KDE games) or the cardpics (see
http://www.nongnu.org/cardpics/) are installed and use those.


Installation
-------------

See the file INSTALL


Documentation
-------------

Is in the doc directory; in HTML-format. If the documentation is properly
installed (make doc-install in the doc subdirectory; see also the file INSTALL)
or the path is specified either in the INI-file or via an option, it can be
accessed from the program (by pressing F1 or via Help - Content).


How to report bugs and/or send patches
--------------------------------------

Bug reports and patches should be send to the e-mail address of the author (me)
(g17m0@lycos.com).

Please include for bugs:

  - The version of the package. In case you don't know: The title of the
    about box.
  - The version of the used libYGP library.
  - How to reproduce the bug.
  - In case of a crash there should also be a stackdump in your systemlog which
    might help in localizing the bug.
  - Anything else you think might be helpful.

Please note that I don't (can't) check my mails daily, so please be patient.
